/T (At Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim, students have the opportunity to experience the beauty and depth of Eres Yisrael through unforgettable tiyulim. From hiking the waterfalls of Ein Gedi and Wadi Kelt to exploring the ancient streets of Yerushalayim and Hebron, each trip brought Tanakh and Jewish history to life. These trips foster camaraderie, spiritual growth, and a deeper connection to the Land of Israel.)
