/T (Night seder at Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim reverberates with energy, as students engage in deep learning with their habrutot and teachers well beyond the formal schedule. Optional learning initiatives creates a vibrant environment of Torah lishmah, with many students pursuing personal growth and even completing masekhtot. Thanks to some of our generous alumni we are able to offer gift cards for sefarim which incentivized late-night learning. The bonds formed during these hours extended far beyond the pages of Tanakh and Gemara that were learned.)
