/T (Our Public Speaking Program has become a powerful part of the Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim experience, giving students the tools to articulate Torah insights with clarity and confidence. Under the guidance of Rabbi Yitzchak Mirsky, students work on their speeches during his shiur, receiving valuable feedback on both content and delivery. Additionally, our weekly Dibre Torah initiative on Instagram showcases the impressive growth in public speaking, communication and leadership among our talmidim- garnering tens of thousands of views!)
