/P 402 0 R
/T (Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim is perfectly located in the heart of Jerusalem, in walking distance of so many iconic, historic and spiritual sites. Nestled in the picturesque streets of Nachlaot, Gan Saker \(an enormous public park with many athletic fields\) is right across the street. The fabled Shuk is a 5 minute walk. The Kotel? About 30 minutes. Ben Yehuda Street is about 12 minutes. )
/E (Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim is perfectly located in the heart of Jerusalem, in walking distance of so many iconic, historic and spiritual sites. Nestled in the picturesque streets of Nachlaot, Gan Saker \(an enormous public park with many athletic fields\) is right across the street. The fabled Shuk is a 5 minute walk. The Kotel? About 30 minutes. Ben Yehuda Street is about 12 minutes. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [16]
