/T (Throughout the year, Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim welcomed an array of guest speakers, including community leaders, alumni, professionals, and rabbis from across Israel. Thursday night mishmars were a highlight, featuring engaging talks on topics ranging from Torah and business ethics to leadership, Halakha and experiences in the IDF. These sessions exposed students to a well-rounded Torah worldview, showing them how to integrate Torah values into every aspect of life.)
/E (Throughout the year, Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim welcomed an array of guest speakers, including community leaders, alumni, professionals, and rabbis from across Israel. Thursday night mishmars were a highlight, featuring engaging talks on topics ranging from Torah and business ethics to leadership, Halakha and experiences in the IDF. These sessions exposed students to a well-rounded Torah worldview, showing them how to integrate Torah values into every aspect of life.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
